data: {"id": "3a63ea4133ae44a0-thinking-parallel_evidence-771", "run_id": "3a63ea4133ae44a0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据对 `aiops-case-v04/workload` 的实时工具调查结果，以下是针对该 Pod 根因证据的诊断说明：\n\n### 已确认事实 (Facts)\n- **Pod 状态**：`Pending` (Kubernetes 状态机)，容器状态 `Waiting` (Reason: `ContainerCreating`)。\n- **事件原因**：`kubectl_describe` 返回了明确且持续的事件 `Warning FailedMount`，原文为：`MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : secret \"unavailable-input\" not found`。该事件在 66 分钟内累计 40+ 次。\n- **Volume 配置**：Pod YAML 显示定义了一个名为 `input` 的 Secret volume (`SecretName: unavailable-input`)，且设置为非可选 (`Optional: false`)。\n- **指标验证**：Prometheus 指标 `kube_pod_co", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789121397769, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

